@startuml kairos-admin-login-sequence
title Admin Login with MFA

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "Auth Provider" as Auth
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Enter email/password\nClick "Login"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /auth/login
API -> Auth: Validate credentials
Auth --> API: Success + userId + roles=[Admin]
API -> DB: SELECT user + MFA settings
DB --> API: user(mfa_enabled=true)
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {requireMfa=true}

Admin -> WebAdmin: Enter MFA code
WebAdmin -> API: POST /auth/mfa/verify {userId, code}
API -> Auth: Verify code
Auth --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {jwt, role=Admin}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Redirect to Admin Dashboard

@enduml
